# sha256 of every file in db/sql, in filename order.
#
# An applied migration is immutable: db/migrate.ts hashes the whole file and
# refuses to run when it no longer matches what helm_migration recorded. This
# manifest moves that failure from deploy time to commit time.
#
# Adding a migration:  pnpm db:check-migrations --update
# Changing one:        do not. Write a new migration that alters what it did.

